<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-Nov budget deficit cut to HUF 111.1 bl.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-Nov budget deficit cut to HUF 111.1 bl.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The accumulated deficit of Hungary's central state budget was 111.1 billion forints for January-November 1996, down from 214.8 billion forints in the same period last year, the Finance Ministry said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>   BUDGET (BLN FORINTS)   Jan-Nov 96   Jan-Oct 95   Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p>   REVENUES		    1,769.1	1,603.9	 n.a.</p>
<p>   EXPENDITURES		1,880.2	1,679.4	 n.a.</p>
<p>   BALANCE		     - 111.1	-  75.5     -214.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The budget deficit target for 1996 is 232.9 billion forints. The figures do not include one-off revenues, e.g. privatisation revenues.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
